+### Selecting columns
+
+For some sources, including Postgres, you can choose which columns to sync for each table. All columns are synced by default. Primary key columns and the active incremental field are always included, and disabled columns are hidden from the table in PostHog. See the [Postgres source docs](/docs/cdp/sources/postgres#selecting-columns-to-sync) for details.
+
 ### Append only
 
 Append only does what it says on the tin: append rows to your table.
